grh-ch3-body : List Word
grh-ch3-body =
  grh-ln "  <p>At the heart of <code>grh-compact/src/New/Main.lean</code> (<code>lines 77&ndash;145</code>) sits <code>star_inequality</code>: the two-sided Arakelov slope sandwich on the rank-<span class='m'><i>d</i></span> evaluation matrix built from CM formal-group jets at the cusp (Theorem A) and cusp forms from the Bessel/Kloosterman sieve (Theorem B). In unfactored form, the upper slope bound and lower Galois/Kummer divisibility floor each carry the leading product <span class='m'><i>d</i> &middot; <i>m</i> &middot; <i>k</i> &middot; <i>U</i> = rowDim &middot; <i>h</i><sub>main</sub></span> across 19 ring multiplications:</p>" (
  grh-ln "  <div class='eq-box'>" (
  grh-ln "    <span class='m'><i>d</i>[(<i>mkU</i> &minus; <i>m</i>&middot;rem + <i>L</i>) + 4<i>x</i><sub>99</sub> + 10<i>B</i><sub>idx</sub>] &minus; <i>d</i>(<i>mkU</i> &minus; 3<i>L</i>) &ensp;&equiv;&ensp; <i>d</i>(4<i>L</i> + 4<i>x</i><sub>99</sub> + 10<i>B</i><sub>idx</sub> &minus; <i>m</i>&middot;rem)</span>" (
  grh-ln "    <span class='eq-sub'><code>ga-cert-star-inequality</code> + <code>ga-thm-star-muls : (#19 , #2) = refl</code> &mdash; <code>d*m*k*U</code> annihilates identically across all rings; 19 multiplications collapse to 2 (&minus;89.5%)!</span>" (
  grh-ln "  </div>" (
  grh-ln "  <p>Simultaneously, <code>ga-cert-star-inequality</code> superoptimizes three companion identities in the same 4-output <code>RProg</code> certificate: (2) exact cancellation of the <span class='m'>4/<i>b</i><sup>2</sup></span> missing-dimension share (<code>0 muls</code>), (3) <code>logLevelTarget</code> excess cancellation <span class='m'><i>m</i>(<i>w&#x0304;</i> + <i>G</i>) &minus; <i>G</i> &minus; <i>b</i><sub>15</sub> &minus; [<i>mw&#x0304;</i> + (<i>m</i>&minus;1)<i>G</i>] &equiv; &minus;<i>b</i><sub>15</sub></span>, and (4) Masullo&#x27;s master <span class='m'>&Copf;</span>-ring trace subtraction <span class='m'>[(spec + ext) &minus; geom] &minus; (spec &minus; geom) &equiv; ext</span>.</p>" (
  grh-ln "  <div class='lab-card' id='labSuperopt'>" (
  grh-ln "    <div class='lab-head'>" (
  grh-ln "      <span class='lbl'>Lab 2 &middot; Universal PolyZ (&Zopf;[X]) Superoptimizer &amp; Silicon / C11 Differential Verifier</span>" (
  grh-ln "      <span class='lab-status' id='soStatus'>Cert: star_inequality_spine (19 &rarr; 2 muls, refl)</span>" (
  grh-ln "    </div>" (
  grh-ln "    <div class='lab-ctrl'>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn on' data-sc='0' type='button'>star_inequality (19&rarr;2)</button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn' data-sc='1' type='button'>space_corank1 (5&rarr;0)</button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn' data-sc='2' type='button'>alpoge_masullo (19&rarr;1)</button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn' data-sc='3' type='button'>poisson_plancherel (8&rarr;0)</button>" (
  grh-ln "    </div>" (
  grh-ln "    <div class='lab-ctrl' style='background:var(--surf)'>" (
  grh-ln "      <span>Artifact View:</span>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn blue on' data-sv='hc' type='button'>1. .hypercubical Cert</button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn blue' data-sv='sv' type='button'>2. SystemVerilog RTL (Verilator)</button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn blue' data-sv='c11' type='button'>3. Zero-UB ISO C11</button>" (
  grh-ln "      <button class='lab-btn' id='btnRunVec' type='button'>Verify 50,000 Ring Vectors</button>" (
  grh-ln "    </div>" (
